    question: 'What is the best platform to sell online courses?',
    answer: '<p><strong>Teachable</strong> is the best platform for most creators, especially those just starting out. It offers an excellent free tier, intuitive course builder, and scales well as you grow. For creators wanting an all-in-one business platform with email marketing and sales funnels built in, <strong>Kajabi</strong> is worth the premium price.</p><p>If you want zero transaction fees and maximum customization, <strong>Thinkific</strong> is an excellent choice with a strong free tier.</p>'
