    answer: '<p>You can start creating courses for <strong>$0 upfront</strong> using free tiers from Teachable, Thinkific, or Gumroad. Your main costs will be:</p><ul><li>Course platform: $0-149/month</li><li>Video equipment: $0 (phone) to $500+ (professional setup)</li><li>Screen recording software: $0-30/month</li><li>Editing software: $0-55/month</li></ul><p>Most creators start with under $100/month in tools and scale up as revenue grows. The free tiers are genuinely usable for launching your first course.</p>'
