  <p>
    <strong>For maximum control:</strong> <strong>Thinkific</strong> offers zero transaction fees and better
    customization. If you want to own more of your course experience and keep 100% of revenue, Thinkific is excellent.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>For serious course businesses:</strong> <strong>Kajabi</strong> is worth the premium price if you want
    email marketing, funnels, and website in one platform. The math works once you're earning consistently.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>For quick validation:</strong> <strong>Gumroad</strong> gets you selling in minutes with no monthly fees.
    Perfect for testing course ideas before committing to a dedicated platform.
  </p>
  <p>
    The best platform is the one you'll actually use. Start with a free tier, create your first course, and upgrade
    when your business justifies the investment. Your audience is waiting for what you have to teach.
  </p>

